TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-0705.2975v1
AU  - Chatzidakis∗, Zoé
AU  - Hardouin, Charlotte
AU  - Singer†, Michael F.
TI  - On the Deﬁnitions of Diﬀerence Galois Groups
DA  - D:20181119
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/0705.2975
AB  - We compare several deﬁnitions of the Galois group of a linear diﬀerence equation that have arisen in algebra, analysis and model theory and show, that these groups are isomorphic over suitable ﬁelds. In addition, we study properties of Picard-Vessiot extensions over ﬁelds with not necessarily algebraically closed subﬁelds of constants.
ER  - 
